## Description

Don't waste 2 years learning to use LLMs like Claude &amp; ChatGPT.  Andrej Karpathy, the godfather of AI, dropped a 2 hour course on how he personally uses LLMs daily.  • 00:00 - LLMs simplified  • 22:49 - which LLM to actually use • 42:00 - one prompt for full research • https://t.co/AMTlHCesam

